heavy calcification.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw text\": \"18. Any target lesion requires treatment with a device other than percutaneous transluminal coronary angioplasty (PTCA) prior to stent placement (e.g. but not limited to, directional coronary atherectomy, excimer laser, rotational atherectomy, etc.).\"}\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw text\": \"19. Any lesion that is located in a saphenous vein graft, however, lesions located within the native vessel but accessed through the graft are eligible.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"raw text\": \"20. The target vessel is in a \"last remaining\" epicardial vessel (e.g. greater than 2 non-target epicardial vessels and the bypass grafts to these territories [if present] are totally occluded).\"}\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw text\": \"21. The patient has a history of myocardial infarction, stroke, or transient ischemic attack. Note: This exclusion criterion does not apply to post-STEMI patients.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"raw text\": \"22. The patient has a history of bleeding diathesis or coagulopathy. Note: This exclusion criterion does not apply to post-STEMI patients.\"\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw text\": \"23. The patient has a history of renal artery stenosis or renal artery disease. Note: This exclusion criterion does not apply to post