nt of solid malignancy or non-melanoma skin cancer within the past 5 years, or any history of melanoma or hematologic or lymphoproliferative malignancy\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"OR\": {\n                                    \"raw_text\": \"Absence of documentation of age-appropriate cancer screening at the time of randomization\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"right\": {\n                                      \"OR\": {\n                                        \"raw_text\": \"Absence of documentation of negative hepatitis B serologies, absence of completion of treatment for chronic hepatitis B, or absence of suppressive antiviral treatment\"\n                                        },\n                                        \"right\": {\n                                          \"OR\": {\n                                            \"raw_text\": \"Unable to provide informed consent\"\n                                            },\n                                            \"right\": {\n                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                \"raw_text\": \"Anticipate not being available or able to comply with the schedule of study visits\"\n                                                }\n                                              }\n                                            }\n                                          }\n                                        }\n                                    }\n                                }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n  }\n}" 

