er active malignancy within the past 5 years except for cervical cancer in situ, in situ carcinoma of the bladder or non-melanoma carcinoma of the skin.\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"right\": {\n                                      \"AND\": {\n                                        \"raw_text\": \"Patients who have received the last administration of an anticancer therapy including chemotherapy, immunotherapy, hormonal therapy and monoclonal antibodies <= 2 weeks prior to starting the study drug, or who have not recovered from the side effects of such therapy.\"\n                                        },\n                                        \"right\": {\n                                          \"AND\": {\n                                            \"raw_text\": \"Cirrhosis, chronic active hepatitis or chronic persistent hepatitis.\"\n                                            },\n                                            \"right\": {\n                                              \"AND\": {\n                                                \"raw_text\": \"Patients who are currently receiving prasugrel.\"\n                                                },\n                                                \"right\": {\n                                                  \"AND\": {\n                                                    \"raw_text\": \"No concurrent use of isoniazid, labetolol, trovafloxacin, tolcapone, and felbamate.\"\n                                                    },\n                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                      \"AND\": {\n                                                        \"raw_text\": \"No concurrent use of other investigational drugs or antineoplastic therapies.\"\n                                                        },\n                                                        \"right\": {\n            