ions or hypersensitivity to any seasonal influenza vaccine component.\"\n                                                    },\n                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                        \"left\": {\n                                                          \"raw_text\": \"Persons with a history of Guillain-Barré Syndrome.\"\n                                                        },\n                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                          \"OR\": {\n                                                            \"left\": {\n                                                              \"raw_text\": \"Receipt of blood or blood products 8 weeks prior to vaccination or planned administration during the three week study period following vaccination.\"\n                                                            },\n                                                            \"right\": {\n                                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                                \"left\": {\n                                                                  \"raw_text\": \"Donation of blood or blood products within 8 weeks prior to vaccination or during the three week study period following.\"\n                                                                  \"right\": {\n                                                                    \"OR\": {\n                                                                      \"raw_text\": \"An oral temperature >100.4° or acute disease within 72 hours prior to vaccination, defined as the presence of a moderate or severe illness (as determined by the investigator through medical history and physical examination; for example, those requiring an absence from work) with or without fever.\"\n                                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                                        \"raw_text\": \"Body Mass Index >29.9.\"\n                                                                        \"right\": {\n                                                                          \"OR\": {\n                                                                            \"raw_text\": \"Any disorder of coagulation.\"\n                                                                            \"right\": {\n                                                                              \"OR\": {\n                                                                                \"raw_text\": \"A clinical diagnosis of influenza within the previous 12 months.\"\n                                                                                \"right\": {\n                                                                                  \"OR\": {\n                                                                                    \"raw text\": \"Any other condition or circumstance which, in the opinion of the Principal Investigator, poses an unacceptable risk for participation in the study.\"\n                                                                                    \"right\": {\n                                                                                      \"OR\": {\n                                                                                        \"raw text\": \"(e.g., HIV positive patients with a CD4 count of 200 or less, patients with active tuberculosis, etc.)\"}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}}