l disease which could lead to priapism such as sickle cell anemia, multiple myeloma, and leukemia\"}\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw text\": \"Subject with active peptic ulceration\"}\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw text\": \"Subject with a history of malignancy within the past 5 years (other than squamous or basal cell skin cancer)\"}\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw text\": \"Subject with a history of a positive test for Hepatitis B surface antigen (HbsAg) or Hepatitis C\"}\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw text\": \"Subject with a known hypersensitivity to any component of the investigational medications, monoamine oxidase inhibitors, phosphodiesterase type 5 inhibitors or phenylethylamines\"}\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw text\": \"Subjects with a history of drug or alcohol abuse within the past 6 months\"}\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw text\": \"Subjects currently consuming =5 units of alcohol per day\"}\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw text\": \"Subject who is illiterate or unable to understand the Informed Consent Form, questionnaires or subject diary\"}\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw text\": \"Subject who, in the opinion of the investigator, will be noncompliant with the visit schedule or study procedures\"}\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"raw text\": \"Subject with any unstable medical, psychiatric, or substance abuse disorder that in the opinion of the investigator is likely to affect the subject's ability to complete the study or preclude the sub