Documentation of HIV diagnosis in the medical record by a healthcare provider.\"\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Tenofovir disoproxil fumarate (TDF) to tenofovir alafenamide fumarate (TAF)/TAF-containing fixed-dose combination regimens
